{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/b1-reskilling-career-longevity/audio/main-05ce2065d29b.mp3","durationSec":242.736,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":2.66,"text":"Upskilling means getting better at your current job."},{"start":3.28,"end":6.72,"text":"You add new skills so that you can do the same work in a stronger way."},{"start":7.6,"end":10.72,"text":"Reskilling means learning skills for a different job or role."},{"start":11.74,"end":14.1,"text":"Lifelong learning is the bigger idea behind both."},{"start":14.8,"end":17.7,"text":"It means you keep learning for your whole life, not only at school."},{"start":18.48,"end":19.58,"text":"Why does this matter now?"},{"start":20.3,"end":22.92,"text":"AI is changing work and the skills workers need."},{"start":23.74,"end":27.82,"text":"Reskilling and upskilling with digital skills help workers learn new technologies."},{"start":28.48,"end":29.6,"text":"Think of a phone."},{"start":29.6,"end":32.32,"text":"It stays useful because it gets updates."},{"start":33.14,"end":35.96,"text":"If it never got an update, it would slowly stop working well."},{"start":36.62,"end":37.62,"text":"A career is similar."},{"start":38.44,"end":39.76,"text":"Your experience is the phone."},{"start":39.76,"end":41.64,"text":"Learning is the update."},{"start":42.4,"end":45.58,"text":"Many people think technology skills are only for engineers or programmers."},{"start":46.42,"end":48.02,"text":"That idea is no longer true."},{"start":48.44,"end":54.58,"text":"Every job now needs some tech literacy, which means a basic ability to understand and use technology."},{"start":55.36,"end":60.24,"text":"It also needs adaptability, the ability to change when new technology arrives."},{"start":61.22,"end":62.48,"text":"Here is an imagined situation."},{"start":63.5,"end":64.88,"text":"Maria works in a small hotel."},{"start":65.44,"end":67.86,"text":"Today, she uses an online booking system."},{"start":68.64,"end":71.9,"text":"She is not a tech worker, but she still needs tech skills."},{"start":72.7,"end":74,"text":"What can we learn from this example?"},{"start":74,"end":75.6,"text":"Programs change."},{"start":76.4,"end":79.34,"text":"What lasts is the habit of learning the next tool quickly."},{"start":80.18,"end":83.38,"text":"So adaptability is not an extra skill for a few people."},{"start":83.8,"end":85.68,"text":"It is a basic skill for everyone."},{"start":86.38,"end":90.06,"text":"If machines can do more, are human skills less important?"},{"start":91.08,"end":92.56,"text":"Employers do not think so."},{"start":93.14,"end":98.56,"text":"They value human skills like communication, attention to detail and leadership very highly."},{"start":99.4,"end":101.52,"text":"Each of these skills does useful work."},{"start":101.52,"end":105.84,"text":"Communication helps a team share ideas and solve problems together."},{"start":106.36,"end":110.58,"text":"Attention to detail means noticing small mistakes before they become big ones."},{"start":111.26,"end":115.64,"text":"Leadership means guiding other people and helping a group move in one direction."},{"start":116.68,"end":118.18,"text":"Here is one way to understand this."},{"start":118.18,"end":122.54,"text":"Technology can give you a fast tool, but people still decide how to use it."},{"start":123.18,"end":127.34,"text":"Someone has to explain a new system to a team, and someone has to check the result."},{"start":128.1,"end":130.1,"text":"Someone also has to lead the change."},{"start":131.1,"end":135.52,"text":"So a strong career plan does not choose between technical skills and human skills."},{"start":136.06,"end":136.98,"text":"It builds both."},{"start":137.64,"end":140.86,"text":"Learning helps your career more when other people can see it."},{"start":141.5,"end":142.82,"text":"There are several ways to show it."},{"start":142.82,"end":148.44,"text":"On-the-job training means learning while you work, often from a colleague or a manager."},{"start":149.5,"end":153.62,"text":"Certifications are official proof that you have passed a test or finished a course."},{"start":154.9,"end":159.08,"text":"Digital badges are small online records that show a skill you have learned."},{"start":159.5,"end":165.5,"text":"Employers can also use digital credentials, which are online records of your learning, to track a worker's progress."},{"start":165.5,"end":168.48,"text":"A credential works like a stamp in a passport."},{"start":169.22,"end":171.14,"text":"Each stamp shows a place you have visited."},{"start":172.1,"end":175.04,"text":"Each badge or certificate shows a skill you have learned."},{"start":176.06,"end":178.42,"text":"However, a certificate is not the end of learning."},{"start":179,"end":183.54,"text":"Because work keeps changing, one certificate today will not cover every need in the future."},{"start":184.44,"end":187.08,"text":"Reskilling is easier when people do not do it alone."},{"start":188.12,"end":192.48,"text":"Lifelong learning is supported best when employers, educators and workers work together."},{"start":193.3,"end":202.7,"text":"Employers can identify the skills they will need in the future, offer tailored training (training made for a person's needs), and use digital credentials to follow progress."},{"start":202.7,"end":209.34,"text":"Clear pathways for upskilling and reskilling help workers adapt and reduce the risk of job loss."},{"start":209.88,"end":212.56,"text":"A pathway is like a map with clear steps."},{"start":213.18,"end":215.72,"text":"Without a map, a worker may feel lost."},{"start":216.52,"end":220.34,"text":"With a map, they can see where they are and what to learn next."},{"start":221.22,"end":223.36,"text":"You can start your own simple map."},{"start":224,"end":228.6,"text":"First, write the skills you already have, both technical and human."},{"start":229.22,"end":232.58,"text":"Next, look at a job you want and write the skills it needs."},{"start":233.1,"end":235.64,"text":"The gap between them shows what to learn next."},{"start":236.24,"end":241.98,"text":"Finally, choose a way to learn it, such as on-the-job training, a course or a certification."}],"words":[{"text":"Upskilling","start":0,"end":0.46},{"text":"means","start":0.46,"end":0.96},{"text":"getting","start":0.96,"end":1.22},{"text":"better","start":1.22,"end":1.56},{"text":"at","start":1.56,"end":1.86},{"text":"your","start":1.86,"end":2.06},{"text":"current","start":2.06,"end":2.3},{"text":"job","start":2.3,"end":2.66},{"text":"You","start":3.28,"end":3.38},{"text":"add","start":3.38,"end":3.6},{"text":"new","start":3.6,"end":3.8},{"text":"skills","start":3.8,"end":4.18},{"text":"so","start":4.18,"end":4.5},{"text":"that","start":4.5,"end":4.64},{"text":"you","start":4.64,"end":4.76},{"text":"can","start":4.76,"end":4.9},{"text":"do","start":4.9,"end":5.04},{"text":"the","start":5.04,"end":5.16},{"text":"same","start":5.16,"end":5.46},{"text":"work","start":5.46,"end":5.74},{"text":"in","start":5.74,"end":5.92},{"text":"a","start":5.92,"end":6.1},{"text":"stronger","start":6.1,"end":6.28},{"text":"way","start":6.28,"end":6.72},{"text":"Reskilling","start":7.6,"end":7.92},{"text":"means","start":7.92,"end":8.42},{"text":"learning","start":8.42,"end":8.76},{"text":"skills","start":8.76,"end":9.18},{"text":"for","start":9.18,"end":9.44},{"text":"a","start":9.44,"end":9.56},{"text":"different","start":9.56,"end":9.8},{"text":"job","start":9.8,"end":10.14},{"text":"or","start":10.14,"end":10.4},{"text":"role","start":10.4,"end":10.72},{"text":"Lifelong","start":11.74,"end":12.06},{"text":"learning","start":12.06,"end":12.44},{"text":"is","start":12.44,"end":12.68},{"text":"the","start":12.68,"end":12.84},{"text":"bigger","start":12.84,"end":13.08},{"text":"idea","start":13.08,"end":13.44},{"text":"behind","start":13.44,"end":13.78},{"text":"both","start":13.78,"end":14.1},{"text":"It","start":14.8,"end":14.94},{"text":"means","start":14.94,"end":